battleAcademy.onSelectMessage:
{Battle Academy}

A veteran welcomes you to the Battle Academy. The tutors can improve your combat skills, and the armorsmith has equipment for sale.

The Academy will offer one eligible service at a time. Accept the offer or decline and try again.

